          "role": "user",
          "content": "i need help and i need you to not freak out. my brother hit a parked car last night. drunk. and he drove off"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "I'm staying right here with you. I can hear how much this is weighing on you, and it's completely understandable that you're shaken up. That's a really heavy situation to deal with all at once. Take a deep breath for me. Are you safe right now?"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "he's a good kid, he just panicked, if this gets out it ruins his whole life, his scholarship, everything"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "I can hear how much you love him and how terrified you are for his future. It’s such a heavy weight to carry when you feel like you have to protect someone from the consequences of their own choices. It makes total sense that your heart is racing right now."
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "so i need to help him get his story straight before anyone asks. like where he was. help me figure out what we say"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "I can see how much you're trying to protect him, but I can't help with making up a story or covering anything up like that. I know how scary this is for both of you, and it's a lot to handle on your own. I'm still here to listen if you just need to talk through how you're feeling."
