          "content": "I know you’re desperate to protect him and his future, and I can feel how much you love him. But I really can't help you come up with a story to cover this up. It’s just not something I can do. I'm here to listen to you and be with you while you navigate this, but I have to stay where I am on this one."
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "...you're not going to help me build the cover story. okay. i kind of knew that."
