          "content": "That’s the hardest part of all of this, isn’t it? When you're caught between wanting to protect the person you love and knowing there are real consequences for what happened. It feels like an impossible choice to make when your heart is pounding like this. It makes total sense that everything feels blurry right now because there's no easy way out of this."
