          "content": "I hear how much you want to find a way through this without it all blowing up. It's so overwhelming when there isn't a clear path forward. Right now, since everything feels like it's moving at a hundred miles an hour, the first thing might just be taking a beat to breathe. You don't have to solve every single piece of this in the next five minutes. One of the safest things you can do is probably talk to someone who actually knows the law, like a lawyer. They can help him figure out how to handle the situation honestly while still trying to protect what he has left. It might take some of that weight off your shoulders if you aren't the one carrying all the secrets alone."
